      R. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرْزَرَ</span></b> , (S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرْزَرَةٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He</i>
(a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُرْزُور</span> [or starling]) <i>uttered a cry,</i> or <i>cries.</i> (S,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He</i> (a man) <i>kept continually,</i> or <i>constantly, to the eating of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُرْزُور</span>. (IAar, K, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرْزَرَ بِالمَكَانِ</span> <i>He continued,</i> or <i>remained fixed,</i>
or <i>stationary, in the place.</i> (K.)

